{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於關注股票回報、風險評估與估值分析的投資者而言，準確的數據運算至關重要。Stock Calculators 是一款專門為輔助投資決策而設計的應用程序，現正提供限時免費下載，讓你無需支付原價 US $0.99 即可體驗其完整功能。</p>\n\n<h2>多元股票指標計算</h2>\n<p>這款應用內建多種專業計算器，協助用戶全面評估股票表現。你可計算收益金額與百分比，透過模擬不同情境來決定止損或獲利時機；根據季度派息分析股息率，並與銀行利息及債券回報作比較。此外，它還能分析 Beta 值以瞭解股價相對市場的波動風險，以及利用市盈率判斷股票是被低估、合理定價還是被高估。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-65-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-66-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-67-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-68-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-69-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Stock Calculators</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T03:58:49.583722+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}